    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when a player enchants an item at an enchanting table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Cancelling the event leaves the item, the player&apos;s experience levels and the lapis lazuli untouched. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Bedrock does not reveal a single hinted enchantment for an offer, so every enchantment the offer applies is listed in <ref refid="classendstone_1_1EnchantItemEvent_1a4c5f362cefa5257b8198b3cdc3b96393" kindref="member">getEnchantsToAdd()</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
